    <data key="d0">3M Fine-Grained Serverless Material Access Architecture</data>
    <data key="d1">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rPGLNw1cOGM</data>
    <data key="d2">3M utilizes a serverless architecture to provide fine-grained access control over proprietary material IP for 8,000+ scientists globally across 50 countries. Fine-grained bitmask authorization is managed via DynamoDB before routing to specialized web (Remix) or programmatic (GraphQL) compute layers.</data>
    <data key="d3">Serverless, Security &amp; Authorization, Databases</data>
    <data key="d4">True</data>
  </graph>
